{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5b52745e35e369952ee272f284440a176565b4a19779d4473e0947d767611950", "ja": "（真のブログがファンに好評のようだ。\n「いつもと気合いが違う」ということらしい……）", "zh": "（真写的博客似乎很受粉丝好评。看来大家都觉得“和往常相比格外认真”……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f4854839c6cd0ce8a1aa18a2fb00e763c8d32cae91e6c9f92e032a09c6e48362", "ja": "なあ、真……。その衣装を紹介するブログに\n書いてあった、新しいキャッチフレーズとは？", "zh": "呐，真……介绍那套服装的博客里，写的那个新宣传语是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "b9231ef59b586af7440cb63a73b4e76b366131fc9a9ca72e474f053a2a90762b", "ja": "待ってました！　それはですね、この衣装って、\nすっごくカワイイじゃないですか！", "zh": "就等您问这句呢！事情是这样的，这套服装不是超级可爱吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "af150e970f0b4fce900595e781120bab16196f0f1e115a78e2752816b0e34de7", "ja": "だから、いつもの挨拶じゃ物足りない気がして。\n新しい挨拶がいいなって思ったんです！", "zh": "所以，我觉得只用平时的问候还不够。\n想着还是用新的问候比较好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1004_p", "source_sha256": "84ae155b65329be084ba795771fd3cb319f2fc2648563a98b34c27dfdf258c81", "ja": "なるほど。\nたしかに新しい挑戦は、いつだって必要かな。", "zh": "原来如此。\n确实，新的挑战总是有必要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "cf076927fa10e23dcee3410738a5b0644ff7c58c54b266808beda2f2e38151d1", "ja": "ですよねですよね！　今思いついてるのは、\nボクのカワイさを集めて放つ、カワイイの正拳突き！", "zh": "就是就是！我现在想到的是——\n\n聚集起我的可爱，然后释放出可爱的正拳突击！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "f9397b6d672bcf0b4ab3c4f32843251a7fe08a149ca7bc4a191e74dea553066c", "ja": "ちょっと待ってくださいね。まず呼吸を整えて……\nはぁぁぁぁ……。よし、行きます！", "zh": "请稍等一下。首先调整呼吸……\n哈啊啊啊啊……好，要上了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "01b3c3e3c8d8e4d5b976bef216d0aed5b48de8fc417e6b87b73c4ba0432a8fe4", "ja": "まこまこパワー、充填完了～☆\nみんなぁ、いっくよ～★", "zh": "真真力量，充填完毕～☆\n大家～，要上啦～★", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "28b9a1b136f57723df663fff58611d746801a2826a473bc0d2d0747dc9118a7b", "ja": "一斉掃射！　まこまこビイ～～～ム♪\nハートの火傷にご用心☆　チュ☆", "zh": "一齐扫射！真真光线——♪  \n小心心被烫伤哦☆ 啾☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "d97d089eec02ac7bcf0d1697188ff0501e3eced7d87da2ea53c3c357810f1ffa", "ja": "ぶはぁ！　や、やっぱりまだ恥ずかしいかな……。\nでも、やりきりました！", "zh": "噗哈！果、果然还是有点害羞啊……\n不过，我还是坚持做完了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "911bb4ba78789b184debeff61ea61c328e59586b6f96f8f9c000fcbb0fa1af49", "ja": "どうですか、{$P$}！\nボクのカワイさを集めて放つ、カワイイの正拳突き！", "zh": "怎么样，{$P$}！\n这是汇聚我的可爱后打出的一记可爱正拳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1012_p", "source_sha256": "32a8f864165fdb0ddecf02afddaaa181390e9b29c92dc9daf39dcef86a100143", "ja": "なるほど？　いや、なるほどじゃないな……。\nえっと……それが、新しいキャッチフレーズか？", "zh": "原来如此？不，不该说原来如此吧……\n那个……这是新的宣传口号吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "a7acdc9a69eda820dd8e24571754d74d81a33a7591d70a5888efea2951b3cddb", "ja": "はい！　この衣装に合わせて考えた、力作です！\nえへへっ……ボクの新しい一面、出てましたよね？", "zh": "是的！这是我配合这套服装想出来的得意之作！\n嘿嘿……展现出了我全新的一面，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "f9546b9f37641922f63b44db2614a4ace96e4a8e3bee95acd2202e45fc6a1e37", "ja": "春香や雪歩に見せたら、すごく微妙な反応でしたけど。\n{$P$}は、どう思います！？", "zh": "给春香和雪歩看的时候，她们的反应都很微妙呢。\n{$P$}觉得怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1015_p", "source_sha256": "010925fc60597d8ad61a5b4a62d7876a8c8be4e0fda4c98a5fbddb0213c1e42e", "ja": "（真からの圧が強い……。\nまあ、基本的にどうかとは思う。でも……）", "zh": "（真给我的压力好大……\n嗯，基本上我确实觉得不太行。不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "8e2f32181eb3c56d4538856ad46ae3f0412dd0560f3ad7a1c66fcb0129714c99", "ja": "……。その反応は、やっぱりダメですよね……。\nわかりました、今のは無しにして……。", "zh": "……。看您的反应，果然还是不行吧……\n我知道了，刚才说的就当没发生过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f6455d7d2154597542cf346ffef781f08c8a2ae7b63ef767f9a676b019d6c2c8", "ja": "いや……どうかな。せっかくの力作なんだろう？\nだったら、公演でちょっと試してみようか。", "zh": "不……难说呢。这可是你难得的力作吧？\n既然如此，不如在演出时试一下看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "685a4087ee396a0f8bd49d2120b45cbae2454349f2a67906170b0c84047f9aea", "ja": "えっ？　い、いいんですか！？", "zh": "诶？真、真的可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1019_p", "source_sha256": "65f1945a2dc48679b72be58478564bd99e979021e63331f939fefdce3c62f102", "ja": "ああ、そこでファンの反応を見てから、\n決めてもいいかな。もしイマイチだったとしても……。", "zh": "嗯，那就先看看粉丝们的反应，再决定也可以。就算效果不太理想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6787466127178f43527a7c3169dc6c11a89941023fa6b50f91e36bc425c0de2e", "ja": "真の魅力は揺るがない。\nどんなキャッチフレーズでも、それは伝わるはずだ。", "zh": "真的魅力不会动摇。\n无论是什么宣传语，都应该能传达出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "8f35cda0ec5151ac0ddd4b7c818403ce3a9d87a65b7af660ac4b7a3ca2752d23", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nへへっ、ありがとうございますっ！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n嘿嘿，谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "52b021a2c81d32599d3c348768ba674ade9cdfb0eebc821009186582c6f21adf", "ja": "じゃあ早速、今日の公演で試していいですよね？\nまこまこビーム？", "zh": "那我现在就可以在今天的公演上试试了吧？\n真真光线？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d62066c505a57be9026cee17a706647ae5fc883048f0b89cfb4e2f3057f44e1f", "ja": "……あ、今日だっけ！？　そ、そうだな。\n俺の心の準備がまだだったけど……いや、大丈夫！", "zh": "……啊，是今天吗！？也、也是啊。\n虽然我心理准备还没做好……不，没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0144_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "03dc3e25b7195ab5951df62d08aceff9885a65fbc3b9382393f1054117afed6e", "ja": "やーりぃ！　楽しみにしててください！\n渾身のカワイイビーム、発射してみせますね♪", "zh": "太棒啦！敬请期待吧！\n我一定会发射出使尽浑身解数的可爱情感光波的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
